          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.030:block:4",
          "start": 1107
        },
        "quote": "(b) Setback and Height Regulations. The height and front, side and rear yard setbacks for individual structures within the planned unit development shall be determined in conjunction with the final approval of the planned unit development plan.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.190.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "2b565d33-4d29-5228-b9e1-b12a8a294db7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1992,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.030:block:5",
          "start": 1352
        },
        "quote": "(c) Off-Street Parking Regulations. The provisions of Chapter 18.240 TMC, Off-Street Parking Requirements, shall apply to the planned unit development district in all respects except for the specified standards establishing the required number of spaces. Off-street parking regulations shall be based on the applicable requirements for each proposed use as set forth in this code. The Planning Director can provide a downward variance from this requirement based on factors provided by the applicant, including, but not limited to, the use of shared parking, nearby public parking or other factors that justify a lesser parking requirement.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.030:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.190.030 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
